  "_warning": "DEPLOYMENT-SPECIFIC CATALOG \u2014 the entries below were mined from ONE deployment's notebooks and are shipped as worked examples. Regenerate this catalog from YOUR notebooks before migrating: wrapper functions NOT listed here are not intercepted, so their writes/drops are NOT redirected into the sandbox during validation.",
  "_comment": "Customer writer-wrapper catalog. Drives the AST-based cell-text rewrite in scripts/job_migrate.py:_apply_wrapper_call_redirect that rewrites literal db/bucket/path args at execution-time to migration_sandbox_overwrite (db) and migration_sandbox (bucket). Saved customer code is NOT modified \u2014 the rewrite is applied only to the exec_code sent to the kernel. Edit this file to add or remove wrappers.",
